%% Hand-authored design projection; not frontend-generated TLC output.
%% Baseline: 1fe3a57d266e1e7fe384796d22a925076f1d99fc. SC_RUN=mac-needed.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued: original admitted once
    Retained --> Queued: RecoverRetained / strict historical proof
    Queued --> Stopping: Begin / owner and transition
    Stopping --> Retained: BeforeRefuse / main busy or unread RED
    Stopping --> Notified: TellDraftPolicy / receipt before destructive stop
    Notified --> Checking: SignalStop / exact old execution
    Checking --> OldEnded: ProviderEnds then VerifyEnd
    Stopping --> OldFallback: StopFailed / freshly proven same old Live
    OldFallback --> OldFallback: RecoverScreen / no blind key
    OldFallback --> OldSelected: Choose(old) and optional ParkDraft
    OldSelected --> OldArmed: Arm / durable original and destination
    OldArmed --> OldReceipt: Submit / provider input effect
    OldReceipt --> OldSettled: Confirm / owner settlement
    OldSettled --> OldCompleted: OldCompletes / exact native processing terminal
    OldCompleted --> Stopping: FallbackDone / migrate without replay
    OldEnded --> Pending: Launch / same native session ID
    Pending --> Created: Create / new incarnation nonce
    Created --> Ready: Attach / own resumed SessionStart and source
    Ready --> NewSelected: Choose(new)
    NewSelected --> NewArmed: Arm
    NewArmed --> NewReceipt: Submit
    NewReceipt --> Done: Confirm
    Queued --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeContent / explicit Cancel or clear
    OldArmed --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeContent / proven NoKeyYet
    NewArmed --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeContent / proven NoKeyYet
    OldReceipt --> EvidenceWait: crash or lost receipt
    NewReceipt --> EvidenceWait: crash or lost receipt
    EvidenceWait --> OldSettled: exact old receipt / never send elsewhere
    EvidenceWait --> Done: exact new receipt / never send elsewhere
    EvidenceWait --> EvidenceWait: LostReceipt RED / no absence-as-NotSent
    note right of Stopping
      Running includes busy/unread composers.
      Generic Return and Codex keep their policies.
      Clear may overtake a transition after 3 seconds:
      recheck owner generation before each effect.
    end note
    note right of Pending
      Crash/Boot may occur between every modeled effect.
      Durable original, destination and launch nonce survive.
      Boot restores custody and wakes the same owner.
    end note
    note right of OldSettled
      Local Enter/receipt is not processing completion.
      Do not kill a provider that still queues this input.
    end note
    Done --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
